(card "exp:C8.4_top3_no_open3min_bypass" :type "experiment"
  :subj "exp:C8.4_top3_no_open3min_bypass"
  :body "---\nnav: 8\ntype: experiment\nid: C8.4\nshort_name: top3_no_open3min_bypass\ntitle: \"C8.4 — top-3 + no_open_3min + high-ratio bypass (Team H sizing base)\"\narc: 260516a\nteam: c\nround: r8\nparent_arc: \"[[arcs/260516a]]\"\nparent_lineage: \"[[lineages/arc_260516a__team_c__no_open3min]]\"\ntrain_nav: 3.1544\ntrain_trade_count: 179\ntrain_win_rate: 0.8771\ntrain_sharpe: 8.3351\ntrain_max_drawdown: -0.0047\nval_nav_mean: 1.0887\nval_nav_sigma: 0.0902\nval_window_count: 13\ntest_nav: 1.4058\ntest_trade_count: 31\ntest_sharpe: 7.7042\ntest_win_rate: 0.8065\ntest_max_drawdown: -0.0029\nanchor_train_nav: 2.1882\nanchor_test_nav: 1.2486\nstatus: champion\noutcome: test_pass\nchampion: false\noverfit_score: 0\nleak_audit: clean\naxis: [whitelist, timing_filter, bypass]\npast_only_window_days: null\nwarmup_required: null\ncreated: 2026-05-17T03:00:00\nlast_updated: 2026-05-17T05:09:00\ntags: [arc/260516a, team/c, round/r8, axis/whitelist, axis/timing_filter, axis/bypass, status/champion, outcome/test_pass, leak/clean, size/large]\n---\n\n# C8.4 — top-3 + no_open_3min + high-ratio bypass\n\n> **TL;DR** —— Team C 在 NAV ranking 切换后冒出来的\"卷王\" trade selector：**top-3 expand + 砍开盘 3min + 高 ratio (>0.40) 绕过 volume cap**。179 笔，train NAV 3.15。**当前所有 H 系列 sizing 候选的 base** —— H-R3b-4 / H-R2-2 / H-R2-1 等都用它选 trade。\n\n## 假设 (Hypothesis)\n- 把 R6 系列的 \"top-3 expand\"（每秒多接 1-2 个 leg）保留，再叠两条独立 lessons：\n  1. **没有 open_3min**：开盘前 3min 的 trade 历史上波动大、win_rate 拉胯（来自 [[arc_260516a__team_b__B-R8-1__no_open3min_bypass03]] 的发现）—— 直接屏蔽。\n  2. **high-ratio bypass**：当 leg ratio > 0.40 时，绕过 baseline_max_avg 的 volume cap（来自 Team B B-R8-2 mechanism）—— 高 ratio leg 不应被 volume cap 砍掉。\n- 假设：这两条加成 + top-3 expand 三个独立 lever 叠加，能在不引入新 leak 的前提下进一步推高 NAV。\n\n## 实现 (Implementation)\n- 主脚本：`/Users/han/project/alpha/alpha_second_v1/arcs/all/260516a_agent_team_beat_current_sota/team_c/scripts/round_8_runner.py` (或同 dir)\n- trade selector 步骤：\n  1. baseline G2 配置\n  2. top-3 expand（同秒同 trigger 接 top-3 leg）\n  3. drop trades with minute_of_day in 开盘 3min\n  4. 当 leg.ratio > 0.40 时，跳过 `baseline_max_avg` cap\n- 输出 179 笔（vs anchor 140）。\n\n## Past-only window 处理\n- C8.4 本身不用 rolling stat（filter 都是 within-trade snapshot）。**无 lookahead 风险**。\n- 注意：H 系列在 C8.4 上加 sizing 时引入了 30d rolling median，是 sizing layer 的事，不在 C8.4 本身。\n\n## 结果 (Results)\n| | NAV | Trades | Sharpe | Win | MaxDD |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| Train | 3.1544 | 179 | 8.34 | 87.7% | -0.47% |\n| Val (rolling 13w) | 1.0887 ± 0.090 | - | - | - | - |\n| Test | 1.4058 | 31 | 7.70 | 80.6% | -0.29% |\n| **Δ test NAV vs anchor** | **+0.157** | +11 | +0.55 | +5.6pp | +0.24pp |\n\n注意 test sharpe 8.34 → 7.70 的下降是预期（hold-out 上信号弱化），但 NAV 仍强势 beat anchor。\nH-R3b-4 在这之上加 sizing 再把 NAV 拉到 1.49（+0.08）。\n\n## 风险 & overfit 嫌疑\n- overfit_score = 0\n- 三条 lever 都独立 falsifiable（R7 系列单独验证过 no_open_3min 与 bypass 的边际贡献）\n- 唯一隐患：bypass 阈值 0.40 是 R7-3 来的固定值，**没在 C 队 sweep**（B 队 sweep 过 0.30/0.40），下次类似实验应 sweep 阈值。\n\n## Lineage（双链网）\n- **derived_from**: [[arc_260516a__team_c__baseline_C7.5__top3_no_open3min]] (C7.5 是 C8.4 的前身，仅缺 bypass)\n- **borrows_mechanism_from**: [[arc_260516a__team_b__B-R8-1__no_open3min_bypass03]] (no_open_3min 和 bypass 的 origin)\n- **base_for**:\n  - [[arc_260516a__team_h__H-R3b-4__c84_kelly_lambda_1.5]] (SOTA)\n  - [[arc_260516a__team_h__H-R2-2__c84_linear_sizing]]\n  - 其它 H-R2-x / H-R3b-x 全系\n- **competes_with**: [[arc_260516a__team_b__B-R8-1__no_open3min_bypass03]] (B 队同 lessons 但走 default-drop 路线)\n- **builds against**: [[arc_260516a__team_anchor__anchor_g2__baseline]]\n\n## Reports\n- `/Users/han/project/alpha/alpha_second_v1/arcs/all/260516a_agent_team_beat_current_sota/team_c/output/round_8/leaderboard.csv` (row 1, gate=NAV_PASS)\n- `/Users/han/project/alpha/alpha_second_v1/arcs/all/260516a_agent_team_beat_current_sota/output/top3_strategies_explainer_20260517_0015.html`\n- [[arc_260516a__reporter_20260517_0547]]\n\n## Notes / 下次迭代\n- C8.4 的真正贡献 = 给 H 系列**搭好了一个 179 笔的 high-quality trade pool**。trade selector 卷到这里基本 plateau；后续 NAV gain 来自 sizing axis。\n- 下次再做 selector 类 lineage 时，\"top-N expand + timing filter + volume bypass\"这套 lever 组合可以直接复用作起点，但记得 sweep bypass threshold (0.30/0.40/0.50)。\n- C8.4 没用 rolling stat 是优点 —— 这意味着 deployment 时 cold-start 无 warmup 需求；H 系列加 sizing 后则需要 ≥10 个 events 才能让 size 生效。\n"
